[b]RGO - Synthesis[/b]

A standalone agricultural RGO overhaul using RGO Harmony's current
compatibility map and required playset. Synthesis is intended to replace
Fruits Expanded integration, grouping related fruits into broader orchard
categories while representing distinctive tropical staples and geographic
origins.

The Phase 1 design aims to improve vanilla's generic fruit abstraction and
historically anachronistic RGO assignments while preserving RGOs as broad
economic representations. This initial scaffold still uses RGO Harmony's
map behavior; Synthesis agricultural changes are not implemented yet.

